Parametro Default Max <code>page</code> 1 — <code>page_size</code> 50 200 <p>Risposta paginata:</p> <pre><code>{
  "data": {
    "count": 142,
    "page": 1,
    "page_size": 50,
    "total_pages": 3,
    "results": [...]
  },
  "meta": { "request_id": "..." }
}
</code></pre> <p>Pattern alternativo (per endpoint che usano <code>limit</code>/<code>offset</code>):</p> <pre><code>{
